      "_comment": "Sparsity-trained checkpoints, one per architecture that has BatchNorm. bn_scale ranks channels by BatchNorm gamma, which discriminates almost nothing on a normally trained network; these were produced by 100 epochs of L1-regularised training, about 5-6 h of GPU each, and are reused across every target of their model. Without them bn_scale cannot be reproduced without redoing that phase. The group_lasso one is the equivalent for that criterion.",
      "patterns": [
